HST Office: the ribbon keeps its groups' labels while there is room (owner decision 15/11/2026, gap list G10).

Gap list G10, owner decision 15/11/2026: every shown group first has its labels; while the row is too wide,
groups give them up in a fixed order per tab (least room saved first, least used first on a tie, groups whose
labels cost under a tenth of their width last), so a wider window never hides a label a narrower one shows.
Groups become their buttons only once no group has labels left, least used first in a fixed order: collapsed
groups no longer reopen out of order (13/11 rule). A group without labels does not grow back.

